<title>SINGAPORE: S.Korean LG-Caltex plans to test crude unit in Oct.</title>
<headline>S.Korean LG-Caltex plans to test crude unit in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's LG-Caltex Oil Corp, a unit of LG Group, plans to test run its new 220,000-barrel-per-day (bpd) crude distillation unit in October, a company spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
